  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Given below are two statements :</p><p>Statement I : The <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#176;</mo></math> value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Ce</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>Ce</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>74</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p>Statement II : Ce is more stable in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Ce</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> state than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Ce</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> state.</p><p>In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below:</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "Both statement I and statement II are correct",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Statement I is incorrect but statement II is correct",
      "is_correct": false
    },
